        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle colors orange, blue, green, red, and rotation modifiers rotate the piece clockwise through 0\u00b0, 90\u00b0, 180\u00b0, and 270\u00b0. A matching goal becomes activated, but it must still be reached and stepped on to complete it. Walls block movement, so blocked_directions must be checked before every action; attempting a blocked direction wastes stamina. When stamina reaches zero, one life is lost and stamina resets, while losing all lives ends the game."
